### No. 3-14_注文（異常系 - カートが空の状態で注文）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
"customerInfo": {
"name": "顧客 太郎",
"email": "test-member-a@example.com",
"address": "東京都品川区",
"phoneNumber": "0123456789"
},
"paymentMethod": "credit_card"
}

### No. 3-15_注文（異常系 - 注文処理中に在庫不足が発生）
### 前提条件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": 1,
    "quantity": 3
}
- データベースでproductId:1 の商品を2個にする

### 入力
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
"customerInfo": {
"name": "顧客 太郎",
"email": "test-member-a@example.com",
"address": "東京都品川区",
"phoneNumber": "0123456789"
},
"paymentMethod": "credit_card",
"items": [
{
"productId": 1,
"name": "シンプルデスクオーガナイザー",
"price": 3500,
"quantity": 3,
"subtotal": 10500
}
],
"totalPrice": 10500,
"shippingFee": 0,
"grandTotal": 10500
}

